figdown 0.1 block
# The ambiguous report with EVIDENCE, and the branch that names it. No
# --color-means, so color= is unclassified and nothing is rewritten — but the
# file is not silent about which reading it supports: it also writes fill=,
# which the FILL reading cannot account for. The message says so and names
# the flag that is left, which is the same deduction refusal (a) makes when
# --color-means=fill is passed (fixture 406).
node a "A" color=#ffffff fill=#0f172a
